</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nightdriver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 3:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you read the jailhouse interviews with Anderson, you will come away knowing less than before you started. It&#39;s kinda obvious that he something to do with it. And yes, her skull was found off SR 17, near the Santa Clara-Santa Cruz county line. That&#39;s about 70 road miles South of Vallejo, not 500. It would be appreciated if you folks would find some other cases to talk about. I thought I was going to be able to forget that Mr. Anderson ever existed. The more I have seen on him, the less I consider him part of the human race.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
