<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12487"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 31, 2005 - 1:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What sh said Mel is, that Pedos. and chld killers spread like fire, like an illness, and the people that get involved make the circle of suspects bigger and bigger, I have talked to someone about the body farm and how the ground will change if you were to bury a child on top of a casket in the dirt. We have been talking about the equipment used to detect solid forms underground, and will be looking at the possibilities. Remember the truth is never told by criminals so I think they are buried on top of caskets notbelw them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
